Cameo Icons — derivation notice
===============================

The SVG artwork in `icons/cameo-light/` and `icons/cameo-dark/` is a
programmatic recolour of the Catppuccin Icons set for Zed. Geometry is
unchanged; only the flat fill/stroke hex values were substituted, mapping
each Catppuccin accent onto a Cameo design-system role.

